<title>UK: IOC buys 90,000 tonnes March gasoline - trade.</title>
<headline>IOC buys 90,000 tonnes March gasoline - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Oil Corp bought 90,000 tonnes of 87-octane leaded gasoline for March 1-15 delivery in a tender that closed on Wednesday, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The tender was originally for four cargoes of 25,000 tonnes each.</p>
<p>European traders said the tender was awarded to a single company.</p>
<p>Details on price were not available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8185</p>
